OL,3,GNEWSANuclear veteran says investigation
OL,4,Aa 'magical moment'                     
OL,6,FMorris, who alongside fellow veterans  
OL,7,Fhave long campaigned for an            
OL,8,Finvestigation, said this announcement  
OL,9,Ffeels different "without a shadow of a 
OL,10,Fdoubt".                                
